<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EST" style="id">RRK17.SFM Runyankore-Rukiga Bible Version 1964 lasted edited 06.07.2022</book>
  <para style="h">ESTEERI</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ekitabo Kya Esteeri</para>
  <para style="toc2">Esteeri</para>
  <para style="toc3">Est</para>
  <para style="mt2">EKITABO KYA</para>
  <para style="mt1">ESTEERI</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EST 1" />
  <para style="s1">Omwigarire okugomera omugabe Ahasuero</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EST 1:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZR 4:6">Ezr 4:6</ref>; <ref loc="EST 8:9">Est 8:9</ref>; <ref loc="EST 9:30">9:30</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu busingye bwa Ahasuero, Ahasuero owaategyekire amashaza igana na makumi abiri na mushanju, okuruga Buhindi okuhika Esiopia, <verse eid="EST 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EST 1:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 1:1">Neh 1:1</ref>. </char></note> omu biro by'ogwo mugabe Ahasuero, ku yaabaire ari aha ngoma omuri Shushani orurembo orukuru, <verse eid="EST 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EST 1:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 40:20">Kut 40:20</ref>; <ref loc="EST 2:18">Est 2:18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:21">Mak 6:21</ref>. </char></note> omu mwaka gwe ogwa kashatu, akateeka obugyenyi, yaayeta abanyiginya be boona, abagaragwa be, abakuru b'amahe aba Buperisi na Bumeedi, abakungu hamwe n'abategyeki b'ago mashaza, baateeranira omu maisho ge, <verse eid="EST 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EST 1:4" />yaamara ebiro igana na makumi munaana naayoreka eitungo ry'obugabe bwe, n'ekitiinisa ky'obukuru bwe ekyabaire kihinguraine. <verse eid="EST 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EST 1:5" />Ebiro ebyo ku byahweire, yaateekyera abantu boona obugyenyi, abakuru n'abato abaabaire bari omuri orwo rurembo rukuru Shushani, bwamara ebiro mushanju omu kibuga ky'aha musiri gw'omu kikaari ky'omugabe. <verse eid="EST 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EST 1:6" />Aho hakaba hakingireho emikingo y'emyenda erikwera, n'eya bururu, ehanikirwe aha bugoye bwa bafuta n'obwa bujwa buhamiibwe empeta z'efeeza aha nyomyo z'amabaare agarikwetwa maburo; kandi aha mabaare agaariire agarikutukura, agarikwera, aga kinekye n'agarikwiragura, baataho ebitanda by'ezaabu n'eby'efeeza. <verse eid="EST 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EST 1:7" />Baabanywaisiza viinyo y'omugabe omu bintu by'ezaabu ebitarikushushana, yaatereka nyingi munonga, nk'obufura bw'omugabe oku bwabaire buri. <verse eid="EST 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EST 1:8" />Abantu baanywa nk'oku ebiragiro byabaire biri, tihaabaho muntu owaagyemwa; ahabw'okuba omugabe akaba aragiire abatware b'ekikaari kye boona kuheereza omuntu weena, nk'oku arikwenda. <verse eid="EST 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EST 1:9" />N'omwigarire Vasita yaateekyera abakazi obugyenyi omu kikaari ky'omugabe Ahasuero.<verse eid="EST 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EST 1:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 13:28">2 Sam 13:28</ref>; <ref loc="EST 2:21">Est 2:21</ref>; <ref loc="EST 6:2">6:2</ref>; <ref loc="EST 7:9">7:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Aha izooba rya mushanju, omugabe Ahasuero ku yaagizire ebyera, yaaragiira Mahumaani, Bizisa, Harabona, Bigusa, na Abaguta, Zesaari na Karakaasi, abakonwa mushanju, abaabire bamuheereza, <verse eid="EST 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EST 1:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 2:17">Est 2:17</ref>. </char></note> kureeta omwigarire Vasita omu maisho ge, ajwaire ekirunga ky'obugabe, kworeka abantu n'abanyiginya oburungi bwe; ahabw'okuba akaba ari murungi w'okureebwa. <verse eid="EST 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EST 1:12" />Kwonka omwigarire Vasita yaayanga kuhurira ekiragiro eki omugabe yaamutumireho abakonwa be ngu aije. Ekyo kyareetera omugabe ekiniga kingi, kyayenda kumubarura.<verse eid="EST 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EST 1:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 2:12">Dan 2:12</ref>, <ref loc="DAN 2:13">13</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 4:6">4:6</ref>, <ref loc="DAN 4:7">7</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 2:1">Mat 2:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima omugabe yaabuuza abahi b'obwengye, abaabaire nibamanya oku bitwazibwa, (ahabw'okuba niyo yaabaire eba entwaza ye okubuuza abarikumanya ebiragiro n'emicwere y'emanja; <verse eid="EST 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EST 1:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 25:19">2 Bag 25:19</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 7:14">Ezr 7:14</ref>. </char></note> kandi abashaija abaabaire nibakurata omugabe omu kitiinisa, bakaba bari Karisheena, Shesaari, Adimaasa, Tarushiishi, Meresi, Mariseena na Memukaani, abanyiginya mushanju aba Buperisi na Bumeedi, abaabaire bari empika-mugabe, baine emyanya mikuru erikukira ey'abandi omu ihanga.) <verse eid="EST 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EST 1:15" />Omugabe yaababuuza ati: Omu biragiro, tugire tuta omwigarire Vasita, oyangire kukora eki omugabe amutumireho abakonwa? <verse eid="EST 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EST 1:16" />Memukaani yaagarukamu ari omu maisho g'omugabe n'abanyiginya ati: Omwigarire Vasita tacumwire ha mugabe wenka, kureka ashobize n'aha banyiginya boona n'amahanga goona agari omu mashaza g'omugabe Ahasuero goona. <verse eid="EST 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EST 1:17" />Ahabw'okuba eki, eki omwigarire akozire, nikiija kumanywa abakazi boona, kibareetere kugaya baibabo, ahakuba nibaija kugira bati: Omugabe Ahasuero ka yaatumire omwigarire Vasita kwija omu maisho ge, akanga. <verse eid="EST 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EST 1:18" />Kandi eri izooba abanyiginyakazi ba Buperisi na Bumeedi, abaahurira eki omwigarire akozire, nibaija kukigambira abanyiginya b'omugabe boona; ekiraarugyemu habeho okugayana kwingi n'okugirirana ekiniga. <verse eid="EST 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EST 1:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 8:8">Est 8:8</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 6:8">Dan 6:8</ref>. </char></note> Nyakusinga, ku oraabe nookisiima, omugabe ateho ekiragiro, ku Vasita atarigaruka omu maisho g'omugabe Ahasuero, kandi kihandiikwe omu biragiro by'Abaperisi n'Abameedi, kirekye kuhindurwa; bwanyima omwanya gwe gw'obwigarire omugabe aguhe ondiijo orikumuhitsa emicwe. <verse eid="EST 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EST 1:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 5:22">Efe 5:22</ref>; <ref loc="COL 3:18">Kol 3:18</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 2:12">1 Tim 2:12</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 3:1">1 Pet 3:1</ref>. </char></note> Kityo ekiragiro ky'omugabe ku kiraarangwe omu bugabe bwe bwona, nk'oku bwingana, abakazi boona nibaija kutiina baibabo, ab'ekitiinisa n'abatakiine. <verse eid="EST 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EST 1:21" />Obwo bwengye bwasiimwa omugabe n'abanyiginya, omugabe yaatwaza nk'oku Memukaani yaamuhabwire. <verse eid="EST 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EST 1:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 3:12">Est 3:12</ref>; <ref loc="EST 8:9">8:9</ref>. </char></note> Yaatweka ebaruha omu mashaza g'obugabe bwe bwona, omuri buri ishaza nk'oku emihandiikire yaaryo eri, kandi n'omuri buri ihanga omu rurimi rwaryo, ngu omushaija weena ashemereire kutegyeka eka ye, kandi ngu nawe akibuzye omu rurimi rw'eihanga rye.<verse eid="EST 1:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EST 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EST 2" />
  <para style="s1">Esteeri okutooranwa kuba omwigarire</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EST 2:1" />Bwanyima y'ebyo, ekiniga ky'omugabe Ahasuero ku kyaikaikaine, yaijuka Vasita n'eki yaakozire, n'ekiragiro eki yaamuteereireho. <verse eid="EST 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EST 2:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 1:2">1 Bag 1:2</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima abagaragwa b'omugabe abaabaire nibamuheereza baamugira bati: Ka basherurire omugabe abaishiki barungi empangare. <verse eid="EST 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EST 2:3" />Kandi omugabe ateho abatware omu mashaza goona ag'omu bugabe bwe, bateeranire hamwe empangare nungi zoona omu nju y'abakazi omu rurembo Shushani, babakwatse Hegai omukonwa w'omugabe, omurinzi w'abakazi; kandi baheebwe ebintu by'okwecuma. <verse eid="EST 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EST 2:4" />Bwanyima omwishiki, ou omugabe arisiima, abe omwigarire omu mwanya gwa Vasita. Omugabe yaasiima egyo naama, yaatwaza atyo.<verse eid="EST 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EST 2:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 9:1">1 Sam 9:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu biro ebyo omu rurembo Shushani, hakaba harimu Omuyudaaya orikwetwa Morodekai, mwene Yairi, mwijukuru wa Shimei, mwene Kiishi Omubenyamiini. <verse eid="EST 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EST 2:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 24:14">2 Bag 24:14</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 24:15">15</ref>; <ref loc="JER 24:1">Yer 24:1</ref>; <ref loc="JER 29:1">29:1</ref>, <ref loc="JER 29:2">2</ref>. </char></note> Omushaija ogwo akaba anyagirwe Yerusaalemu, atwairwe n'ezindi nkwatwa, na Yekonia omugabe wa Yuda, ou Nebukadeneeza omugabe wa Babulooni yaatwaire. <verse eid="EST 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EST 2:7" />Morodekai ogwo akoorora Hadasa muhara wa ishento, niwe Esteeri; ahabw'okuba akaba ari efuuzi, ataine ishe na nyina; kandi ogwo mwishiki akaba akuzire gye, kandi ari murungi w'okureebwa. Ishe na nyina ku baaherize kufa, Morodekai yaamutwara, yaamworora nk'omwana we ou ayezaariire. <verse eid="EST 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EST 2:8" />Bwanyima ekiragiro ky'omugabe, ku kyaherize kubuga, abaishiki baingi baateeranirwa omu rurembo Shushani kurindwa Hegai; na Esteeri yaatwarwa omu kikaari ky'omugabe, yaakwatsibwa Hegai omurinzi w'abakazi. <verse eid="EST 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EST 2:9" />Ogwo mwishiki yaasiimwa Hegai, yaamugiraho obuganzi. Hegai yaarahuka kumuha eby'okwecuma, n'egabo ye, n'abazaana mushanju abaarugire omu kikaari ky'omugabe, abu yaabaire ashemereire kuheebwa; yaamutoorana omu bandi, yaamutwara n'abazaana be, yaamuta omu mwanya ogurikukira oburungi omu nju y'abakazi. <verse eid="EST 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EST 2:10" />Kandi Esteeri ogwo akaba atakagambaga ihanga rye, n'obu baakuba beene waabo; ahabw'okuba Morodekai akaba amwehanangiriize kutabigamba. <verse eid="EST 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EST 2:11" />Kandi Morodekai akaba agyendagyenda obutoosha omu maisho g'ekikaari ky'enju y'abakazi, ngu amanye Esteeri oku ari, kandi n'oku ariba.<verse eid="EST 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EST 2:12" />Kandi omwishiki ku yaabaire aheza ameezi ikumi n'abiri naayecuma nk'ebiragiro by'abakazi oku biri, akaba amurikirwa omugabe Ahasuero; ahakuba ameezi ago nigo gaabaire garagiirwa kwecumiramu, ameezi mukaaga nibeesiiga amajuta ga sumuruna, n'agandi mukaaga eby'emigaju n'amajuta ag'okwarika abakazi. <verse eid="EST 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EST 2:13" />Omwishiki ku yaabaire aza kutaaha ow'omugabe, aheebwa ekintu kyona eki arikwenda omu nju y'abakazi kugyendana omu kikaari ky'omugabe. <verse eid="EST 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EST 2:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 4:11">Est 4:11</ref>. </char></note> Akaba azayo omu mwabazyo, agaruka omu kasheeshe, ataaha omu nju y'abakazi eya kabiri, akwatsibwa Shaashigazi omukonwa w'omugabe, owaabaire arinda ebinyanshunju; akaba atagaruka w'omugabe, kureka omugabe ku yaabaire amukunda, amweta naamugamba eiziina.<verse eid="EST 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EST 2:15" />Bwanyima obunaku bwa Esteeri, muhara wa Abihaili, ishento wa Morodekai owaamworoire nk'omwana we, bw'okumurikirwa omugabe, bwahika. Ku baamwetsire, tiyaagira ki yaashaba, kureka eki yaasiimiirwe Hegai omukonwa w'omugabe kandi omurinzi w'abakazi. Atyo Esteeri yaasiimwa boona abaamureebire. <verse eid="EST 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EST 2:16" />Kandi Esteeri yaatwarwa aha mugabe Ahasuero omu kikaari ky'omugabe omu kwezi kwa ikumi okurikwetwa Tebesi, omu mwaka gwe gwa mushanju agiire aha ngoma. <verse eid="EST 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EST 2:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 1:11">Est 1:11</ref>. </char></note> Omugabe, ku yaareebire Esteeri, yaamukunda okukira abandi bakazi boona, Esteeri yaagirirwa embabazi omu maisho ge, kandi yaakundwa okukira ezo mpangare zoona; omugabe yaamujweka ekirunga aha mutwe, yaamugira omwigarire omu mwanya gwa Vasita. <verse eid="EST 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EST 2:18" />Bwanyima omugabe yaateekyera abanyiginya be boona n'abagaragwa be obugyenyi bwingi munonga ahabwa Esteeri. Kandi yaasaasira amashaza ge goona omushoro, yaahereza ebiconco nk'omugabe. <verse eid="EST 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EST 2:19" />Kandi abaishiki, ku baateerainwe obwa kabiri, Morodekai akaba ashutami aha irembo ry'omugabe; <verse eid="EST 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EST 2:20" />(obwo Esteeri akaba atakagambaga beene waabo nari eihanga rye, nk'oku Morodekai yaabaire amwehanangiriize; ahabw'okuba Esteeri akaba ayorobera Morodekai, nk'oku yaabaire amworobera, naakimworora).<verse eid="EST 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Morodekai okugamba enaama y'abazigu b'omugabe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EST 2:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EST 1:10">Est 1:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu biro ebyo Morodekai ku yaabaire ashutami aha irembo ry'omugabe, abashaija babiri b'omu bakonwa b'omugabe, abaabaire barinda orwigi, Bigisaana na Tereshi, baagira ekiniga, baaza omu naama y'okwita omugabe Ahasuero. <verse eid="EST 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EST 2:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 6:2">Est 6:2</ref>. </char></note> Enaama yaabo yaamanywa Morodekai, yaagigambira omwigarire Esteeri, omwigarire yaagimugambirira omugabe. <verse eid="EST 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EST 2:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 6:1">Est 6:1</ref>. </char></note> Ku baabibuuriririize, baashanga biri kwo, abo bashaija bombi baahanikwa aha biti. Ekyo kyahandiikirwa omu maisho g'omugabe omu kitabo ky'ebyabaireho.<verse eid="EST 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EST 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EST 3" />
  <para style="s1">Enaama ya Hamani y'okucwekyereza Abayudaaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EST 3:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 15:32">1 Sam 15:32</ref>, <ref loc="1SA 15:33">33</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima y'ebyo omugabe Ahasuero yaakuza Hamani mwene Hamedasa Omuagagi, yaamugira omutegyeki mukuru, ekitebe kye yaakiha omwanya gw'ahaiguru okukira eby'abanyiginya bagyenzi be boona. <verse eid="EST 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EST 3:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:2, 5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 5:9">Est 5:9</ref>. </char></note> Abashaija b'omugabe boona, abaabaire batuura aha irembo ry'omugabe bakaba bamwinamira, bamutangirira; ahakuba omugabe nikwo yaabaire aragiire. Kwonka Morodekai we akaba atamwinamira, n'obu kwakuba okumutangirira. <verse eid="EST 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EST 3:3" />Bwanyima abo bashaija b'omugabe baabuuza Morodekai ogwo bati: Ahabw'enki noohenda ekiragiro ky'omugabe? <verse eid="EST 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EST 3:4" />Baaguma nibamuteisa buri izooba, yaayanga kubahurira, nabo nikwo kubigambira Hamani, ngu bareebe ku araabe naikiriza ebya Morodekai; ahabw'okuba akaba naayetonganira ngu n'Omuyudaaya. <verse eid="EST 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EST 3:5" />Hamani ku yaareebire Morodekai ataamwinamira, n'obu kwakuba okumutangirira, yaagira ekiniga kingi. <verse eid="EST 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EST 3:6" />Kwonka yaareeba okukwata Morodekai wenka, ku kitaine mugasho; ahabw'okuba bakaba bamugambiire eihanga rya Morodekai. N'ahabw'ekyo yaasherura oburyo bw'okucwekyereza Abayudaaya boona, abaabaire bari omu bugabe bwona obwa Ahasuero, eihanga rya Morodekai.<verse eid="EST 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EST 3:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EST 9:24">Est 9:24</ref>, <ref loc="EST 9:26">26</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima omu mwaka gwa ikumi n'ebiri ogw'omu busingye bw'omugabe Ahasuero, omu kwezi kw'okubanza okurikwetwa Nisani, baaragurisa Puuri, nikwo kuteera enteenyu, baaguma nibakikorera omu maisho ga Hamani buri izooba, ngu babone kumanya ekiro n'okwezi nibakuratanisa ebiro n'ameezi byona okuhitsya obu enteenyu yaakwatsire ekiro kya ikumi na bishatu ky'okwezi kwa ikumi n'abiri okurikwetwa Adari. <verse eid="EST 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EST 3:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 4:8">Bir 4:8</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 16:20">Byak 16:20</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 16:21">21</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima Hamani yaagambira omugabe Ahasuero ati: Hariho eihanga eryataataine rikajanjaara omu mashaza g'omu bugabe bwawe goona; ebiragiro byaryo tibiri nk'eby'agandi mahanga, kandi tibarikworobera biragiro by'omugabe; n'ahabw'ekyo tikiine ki kirikugasira omugabe kurigumisiririza. <verse eid="EST 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EST 3:9" />Nyakusinga omugabe, ku oraabe nookisiima, hateebweho ekiragiro kihandiikwe, bacwekyerezibwe; nyowe niinyija kuha etalanta z'efeeza kakumi, zaakiirwe abarikureeberera omurimo gw'omugabe, bazite omu mabiikiro ge. <verse eid="EST 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EST 3:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 7:6">Est 7:6</ref>; <ref loc="EST 8:1">8:1</ref>, <ref loc="EST 8:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 41:42">Kut 41:42</ref>. </char></note> Atyo omugabe yaajuura empeta y'akamanyiso ke, yaagiha Hamani mwene Hamedasa Omuagagi, omuzigu w'Abayudaaya. <verse eid="EST 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EST 3:11" />Omugabe yaagira Hamani ati: Efeeza zaawe yegumire nazo, kandi eryo ihanga naarikuha, origire nk'oku orikwenda.<verse eid="EST 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EST 3:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EST 1:22">Est 1:22</ref>; <ref loc="EST 8:8-10">8:8-10</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 21:8">1 Bag 21:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima aha kiro kya ikumi na bishatu ky'okwezi kw'okubanza abahandiiki b'omugabe baayetwa, baahandiika ebi Hamani yaaragiira byona, baabitwekyera abategyeki b'omugabe, n'abategyeki abaabaire nibatwara amashaza g'omu bugabe bwe bwona, n'abanyiginya b'amahanga goona, omuri buri ishaza omu mihandiikire yaaryo, n'omuri buri ihanga omu rurimi rwaryo. Baabihandiika omu iziina ry'omugabe Ahasuero, baataho akamanyiso k'empeta ye. <verse eid="EST 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EST 3:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 30:6">2 Bus 30:6</ref>. </char></note> Ezo baruha zaatwarwa baamatarisi omu mashaza g'omugabe goona, nizigamba kucwekyereza, okwita n'okumaraho Abayudaaya boona, abato n'abakuru, abaana n'abakazi, aha izooba rimwe, aha kiro kya ikumi na bishatu ky'okwezi kwa ikumi n'abiri okurikwetwa Adari, kandi n'okunyaga ebintu byabo; <verse eid="EST 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EST 3:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 8:13">Est 8:13</ref>, <ref loc="EST 8:14">14</ref>. </char></note> kandi ngu ebihandiikirwe omuri egyo baruha bishemereire kubugibwa omuri buri ishaza nk'ekiragiro, nibagambira amahanga goona kweteekatekyera eryo izooba. <verse eid="EST 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EST 3:15" />Baamatarisi baagyenda nibeehuta ahabw'ekiragiro ky'omugabe, kandi ekyo kiragiro kyabugibwa omu rurembo rukuru Shushani. Omugabe na Hamani baashutama kwenywera, kwonka ab'omuri orwo rurembo Shushani baashoberwa.<verse eid="EST 3:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EST 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EST 4" />
  <para style="s1">Obusaasi bw'Abayudaaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EST 4:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 19:1">2 Bag 19:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Morodekai ku yaamanyire ebibaireho byona, yaataagura ebijwaro bye, yaajwara ebiguniya, yaayeshukyera eiju, yaashohora, yaaza omu rurembo ahagati, yaayamuza naataka n'eiraka rihango ry'obusaasi. <verse eid="EST 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EST 4:2" />Bwanyima yaaza aha irembo ry'omugabe, ahabw'okuba tihariho waabaire naikirizibwa kutaaha omu kikaari ajwaire ebiguniya. <verse eid="EST 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EST 4:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 4:16">Est 4:16</ref>; <ref loc="EST 9:31">9:31</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 58:5">Isa 58:5</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 9:3">Dan 9:3</ref>. </char></note> Kandi omu mashaza goona, ei ekiragiro ky'omugabe kyabaire kihika, Abayudaaya bagira amaganya maingi, beesiibyakwo, barira nibaborooga, kandi abaingi omuribo babyama ahansi aha biguniya n'omu iju.<verse eid="EST 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Morodekai okutuma ahari Esteeri okweshengyerereza Abayudaaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EST 4:4" />Bwanyima abazaana b'omwigarire Esteeri, n'abakonwa be, baija, baabimugambira; yaagira obusaasi bwingi; yaayoherereza Morodekai ebijwaro by'okujwara, ngu ajure ebiguniya; kwonka we yaabyanga. <verse eid="EST 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EST 4:5" />Bwanyima Esteeri yaatuma kweta Hasaki, omwe aha bakonwa b'omugabe, ou omugabe yaabaire ataireho kumuheereza, yaamuragiira kuza ahari Morodekai kumubuuza ebibaireho n'ekibireetsire. <verse eid="EST 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EST 4:6" />Atyo Hasaki yaagyenda, yaashanga Morodekai omu kibuga ky'orurembo, omu kangara-teete omu maisho g'eirembo ry'omugabe. <verse eid="EST 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EST 4:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 3:9">Est 3:9</ref>. </char></note> Morodekai yaamuteekyerereza ebimubaireho byona, n'omubaro gw'empiiha zoona ezi Hamani araganiise kuta omu ibiikiro ry'omugabe, ahabw'okucwekyereza Abayudaaya. <verse eid="EST 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EST 4:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 3:14">Est 3:14</ref>. </char></note> Kandi yaamuha ebigambo ebihandiikirwe omu kiragiro ekibugiibwe omuri Shushani, eky'okubacwekyereza, ngu abyorekye Esteeri, abimushobororere, amwehanangirize kuza aha mugabe kumweshengyereza n'okumushaba kukiza eihanga rye. <verse eid="EST 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EST 4:9" />Hasaki yaagaruka ahari Esteeri, yaamugambira obutumwa bwa Morodekai. <verse eid="EST 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EST 4:10" />Bwanyima Esteeri yaagaruka yaatuma Hasaki ahari Morodekai naamugira ati: <verse eid="EST 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EST 4:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 6:4">Est 6:4</ref>. </char></note> Abaheereza b'omugabe boona, n'abantu b'omu mashaza ge nibamanya ngu omuntu weena, yaaba mushaija nari omukazi, orikuza ow'omugabe omu kikaari ky'omunda ateetsirwe, hariho ekiragiro kimwe aha muntu nk'ogwo, nikwo kwitwa, kureka ou omugabe yaimukiza enkoni ye ey'ezaabu, ngu arekye kufa. Kandi naanye hahingwire ebiro makumi ashatu nteetsirwe kushanga omugabe. <verse eid="EST 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EST 4:12" />Baagambira Morodekai ebigambo bya Esteeri. <verse eid="EST 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EST 4:13" />Atyo Morodekai yaabagambira kugarukamu Esteeri bati: Otateekateeka ngu noija kuhonoka aha bandi Bayudaaya boona, ngu ahabw'okuba ori omuri nyaruju y'omugabe. <verse eid="EST 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EST 4:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 45:7">Kut 45:7</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 50:20">50:20</ref>. </char></note> Omanye ngu, ku oraahuname omu biro ebi, eky'okuhuumuriza n'okukiza Abayudaaya nikiija kureetwa ahandi, kwonka iwe n'enju ya sho muryacwekyerera. N'oha orikumanya ekyakutaire aha ngoma, ku kutari kuhwera omu bunaku bw'akabi nk'obu? <verse eid="EST 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EST 4:15" />Esteeri nawe yaabaragiira kugarukamu Morodekai ati: <verse eid="EST 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EST 4:16" />Gyenda oteeranire hamwe Abayudaaya boona abari omu rurembo Shushani, mwesiibyekwo ahabwangye, mumare ebiro bishatu nyomushana na nyekiro, mutarikurya n'obu kwakuba okunywa. Naanye n'abazaana bangye twaza kwesiibyakwo nkaimwe. Bwanyima y'ebyo niinyija kuza ow'omugabe, n'obu kiraabe kitari ky'ebiragiro; ku ndaabe ningwayo, ngweyo. <verse eid="EST 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EST 4:17" />Atyo Morodekai yaayegyendera, yaakora ebi Esteeri yaamuragiira byona.<verse eid="EST 4:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EST 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EST 5" />
  <para style="s1">Esteeri okweta omugabe na Hamani aha bugyenyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EST 5:1" />Aha kiro kya kashatu Esteeri yaajwara ebijwaro bye by'obwigarire, yaaza omu kibuga ky'omugabe eky'omunda, yaayemerera aharikureebana n'enju y'omugabe; kandi omugabe akaba ashutami aha kitebe ky'obugabe omuri nyaruju ye, aharikureebana n'eirembo eririkutaaha omu kibuga. <verse eid="EST 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EST 5:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 4:11">Est 4:11</ref>; <ref loc="EST 8:4">8:4</ref>. </char></note> Omugabe ku yaareebire omwigarire Esteeri ayemereire omu kibuga, yaamushemerererwa, yaamwimukiza enkoni y'ezaabu eyaabaire eri omu ngaro ze. Atyo Esteeri yairira haihi, yaakora aha ifundo ryayo. <verse eid="EST 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EST 5:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:3, 6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 7:2">Est 7:2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:23">Mak 6:23</ref>. </char></note> Omugabe yaamubuuza ati: Omwigarire Esteeri, oine eki orikwenda? Nooshaba ki? Eki orikushaba kyona ninkikuha, n'obu kyakuba ekicweka ky'obugabe bwangye. <verse eid="EST 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EST 5:4" />Esteeri yaagira ati: Nyakusinga omugabe, ku oraabe nookisiima, eri izooba oije na Hamani aha bugyenyi obu nkuteekateekyeire. <verse eid="EST 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EST 5:5" />Omugabe yaagira ati: Nimwete Hamani juba, eki Esteeri arikwenda kikorwe. Atyo omugabe na Hamani baija aha bugyenyi obu Esteeri yaabaire abateekateekyeire. <verse eid="EST 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EST 5:6" />Ku baabaire nibanywa viinyo, omugabe yaamugira ati: N'enki, Omwigarire Esteeri? Nooshaba ki, okakiheebwa? Noija kukiheebwa, n'obu kiraabe ekicweka ky'obugabe bwangye. <verse eid="EST 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EST 5:7" />Esteeri yaamugarukamu ati: Eki ndikushaba, kandi eki ndikwenda nikyo eki. <verse eid="EST 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EST 5:8" />Ku ndaabe ndi ow'okugirirwa embabazi omu maisho g'omugabe, kandi omugabe ku araabe naakisiima kumpa eki ndikushaba, n'okuhikiiriza eki ndikwenda, omugabe na Hamani bagarukye nyencakare aha bugyenyi obu ndaabateekateekyere; obwo nibwo ndaakore eki omugabe yaagamba.<verse eid="EST 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Hamani okubyara ekiti ky'okuhanikaho Morodekai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EST 5:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EST 3:5">Est 3:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eryo izooba Hamani yaashohora ashemereirwe kandi ananukire. Ku yaareebire Morodekai ari omu irembo ry'omugabe ataamwimukira n'obu kwakuba kumuhigiza, yaamugirira ekiniga kingi. <verse eid="EST 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EST 5:10" />Kwonka yaagumisiriza, yaataaha omuka, yaatuma kweta banywani be n'omukazi we Zereshi; <verse eid="EST 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EST 5:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 3:1">Est 3:1</ref>; <ref loc="EST 9:7-10">9:7-10</ref>. </char></note> yaabagambira ekitiinisa eki aine ahabw'obutungi bwe, abaana be ku bari baingi, na byona ebi omugabe amukurizemu, akamutunguura okukira abanyiginya n'abandi bagaragwa be. <verse eid="EST 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EST 5:12" />Kandi Hamani yaagaruka yaagira ati: Nangwa n'omwigarire Esteeri tiyaayeta ondiijo kwija n'omugabe aha bugyenyi kureka nyowe nyenka. Kandi na hati yaanyeta n'omugabe aha bugyenyi nyencakare. <verse eid="EST 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EST 5:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 2:19">Est 2:19</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka ebyo byona tibiine ki birikungasira, ninkireeba ogwo Muyudaaya Morodekai ashutami omu irembo ry'omugabe. <verse eid="EST 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EST 5:14" />Bwanyima Zereshi omukazi we n'abanywani be boona baamugira bati: Ka bakore ekiti ky'oburaingwa bwa mikono makumi ataano, kibyarwe; omu kasheeshe ogambire omugabe, bakihanikyeho Morodekai, obone kuza aha bugyenyi n'omugabe oshemereirwe. Egyo naama yaashemeza Hamani; yaabyara ekyo kiti.<verse eid="EST 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EST 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EST 6" />
  <para style="s1">Omugabe okuzimuurira Morodekai ahabw'eki yaakozire</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EST 6:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EST 2:23">Est 2:23</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 6:18">Dan 6:18</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ekyo kiro omugabe yaabura oturo; yaaragiira ku bamureetera ekitabo ekirikwijutsya ebyabaireho, baakimushomera. <verse eid="EST 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EST 6:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 2:21">Est 2:21</ref>, <ref loc="EST 2:22">22</ref>. </char></note> Baashanga kihandiikirwemu, ku Morodekai niwe yaaregire abashaija babiri b'omu bakonwa b'omugabe, abaabaire barinda omuryango gw'enju ye, Bigisaana na Tereshi, abaabaire nibenda kwita omugabe Ahasuero. <verse eid="EST 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EST 6:3" />Omugabe yaabuuza ati: Beitu Morodekai ogwo hariho ekitiinisa nari obukuru, ebi arahairwe, nibamuzimuurira ekyo eki yaakozire? Abagaragwa b'omugabe abaabaire nibamuheereza, baagarukamu bati: Taine ki arakoreirwe. <verse eid="EST 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EST 6:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 5:14">Est 5:14</ref>. </char></note> Omugabe yaababuuza ati: N'oha ori omu kibuga? Kandi Hamani akaba yaahika ati omu kibuga eky'aheeru ky'ekikaari ky'omugabe, naaza kumugambira eby'okuhanika Morodekai ahari ekyo kiti, eki yaabaire amuteekateekyeire. <verse eid="EST 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EST 6:5" />Batyo abagaragwa b'omugabe baamugira bati: Hamani niwe ayemereire omu kibuga, Nyakusinga. Omugabe yaagira ati: Mumurekye aije. <verse eid="EST 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EST 6:6" />Atyo Hamani yaija; omugabe yaamugira ati: Tukorere ki omushaija ou omugabe arikusiima kuha ekitiinisa? Hamani yaagira omu mutima gwe ati: Ni muntu ki ogwo, ou omugabe arikusiima kuha ekitiinisa kukira nyowe? <verse eid="EST 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EST 6:7" />Hamani nikwo kugarukamu omugabe ati: Omushaija ou omugabe arikusiima kuha ekitiinisa, <verse eid="EST 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EST 6:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 1:33">1 Bag 1:33</ref>. </char></note> ka bareete bushuuti y'omugabe, ei omugabe ajwara, bareete n'embaraasi ei omugabe atemba, eine ekirunga ky'obugabe aha mutwe; <verse eid="EST 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EST 6:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 15:30">2 Sam 15:30</ref>. </char></note> ebyo bijwaro n'egyo mbaraasi babikwatse omwe aha banyiginya b'omugabe abarikweshumba abandi, aije ajwekye ogwo mushaija ou omugabe arikusiima kuha ekitiinisa, amutembye embaraasi, amurabye omu kibuga kihango ky'orurembo amwebebembeire, naaranga ati: Oku nikwo omushaija weena araatwazibwe ou omugabe araasiime kuha ekitiinisa. <verse eid="EST 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EST 6:10" />Ahonaaho omugabe yaagira Hamani ati: Rahuka oreete ebijwaro n'embaraasi, nk'oku waagamba, otwaze otyo Morodekai Omuyudaaya, oshutama aha irembo ry'omugabe. Otagira eki waatsiga ahari ebyo byona ebi waagamba. <verse eid="EST 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EST 6:11" />Atyo Hamani yaihayo bushuuti n'embaraasi, yaajweka Morodekai, yaamurabya omu kibuga kihango ky'orurembo, naaranga ati: Oku nikwo omushaija weena aritwazibwa ou omugabe arisiima kuha ekitiinisa.<verse eid="EST 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EST 6:12" />Bwanyima Morodekai yaagaruka aha irembo ry'omugabe; kwonka Hamani yaayehuuta, yaataaha owe ayetwekyereire aha mutwe naarira. <verse eid="EST 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EST 6:13" />Yaateekyerereza omukazi we Zereshi na banywani be boona ebyamubaho. Abahi be b'obwengye n'omukazi we Zereshi baamugira bati: Morodekai ogwo, ou waatandika kufoobeera omu maisho ge, ku araabe ari ow'omu ihanga ry'Abayudaaya, torimubaasa, kureka noija kugwa omu maisho ge. <verse eid="EST 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EST 6:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 5:8">Est 5:8</ref>. </char></note> Ku baabaire nibakigamba nawe, abakonwa b'omugabe baija, baatwara Hamani aha bugyenyi obu Esteeri yaabaire ateekire nibeehuuta.<verse eid="EST 6:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EST 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="EST 7" />
  <para style="s1">Esteeri okutonganira eihanga rye; n'okuhanikwa kwa Hamani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EST 7:1" />Batyo omugabe na Hamani baaza aha bugyenyi kurya n'omwigarire Esteeri. <verse eid="EST 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EST 7:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 5:3">Est 5:3</ref>, <ref loc="EST 5:6">6</ref>; <ref loc="EST 9:12">9:12</ref>. </char></note> Ahari ekyo kiro kya kabiri, ku baabaire nibanywa viinyo, omugabe yaagaruka yaabuuza Esteeri ati: Hari omwigarire Esteeri, nooshaba ki? Noija kukiheebwa. N'enki eki orikwenda? Eki oraashabe kyona, n'obu kiraabe kiri ekicweka ky'obugabe bwangye, nikiija kuhikiirizibwa. <verse eid="EST 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EST 7:3" />Omwigarire Esteeri yaagarukamu ati: Nyakusinga omugabe, ku ndaabe ndi ow'okugirirwa embabazi omu maisho gaawe, kandi ku oraabe nookisiima, ninkushaba amagara gangye, kandi ninkweshengyereza ahabwa beene waitu; <verse eid="EST 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EST 7:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 3:9">Est 3:9</ref>, <ref loc="EST 3:13">13</ref>. </char></note> ahabw'okuba nyowe n'eihanga ryaitu, tuguzirwe ngu twitwe, tucwekyerezibwe, tumarweho. Nangwa kuri tuguzirwe ngu tube abahuuku n'abazaana, tiinyine ki naakugambire, n'obu omuzigu waitu atakubaasize kuriha ebi omugabe yaakufeereirwe. <verse eid="EST 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EST 7:5" />Ahonaaho omugabe Ahasuero yaabuuza omwigarire Esteeri ati: N'oha oyehangire kukora ekyo, kandi arahi? <verse eid="EST 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EST 7:6" />Esteeri yaagarukamu ati: Omuzigu waitu orikuturwanisa n'eri ihano Hamani. Hamani yaatetemera omu maisho g'omugabe n'omwigarire. <verse eid="EST 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EST 7:7" />Ahonaaho omugabe yaimuka, yaaruga aha bugyenyi asambisiirwe, yaashohora, yaaza omu musiri gw'ekikaari; kwonka Hamani yaimuka kushaba omwigarire ngu ataitwa; ahabw'okuba akareeba ku omugabe amaririire kumukora kubi. <verse eid="EST 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EST 7:8" />Bwanyima omugabe yaagaruka naaruga omu musiri gw'ekikaari, yaataaha omu kishengye omu baabaire nibanywera viinyo, yaashanga Hamani ajuumaire aha kitabo ahu Esteeri yaabaire ari; omugabe yaagira ati: Kandi yaaza kuhambira omwigarire omu maisho gangye omu nju yangye? Ebigambo ebyo ku byarugire biti omu kanwa k'omugabe, abantu baashweka Hamani ahamaisho. <verse eid="EST 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EST 7:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 1:10">Est 1:10</ref>; <ref loc="EST 2:22">2:22</ref>; <ref loc="EST 5:14">5:14</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima Harabona, omwe aha bakonwa abaabaire nibaheereza omugabe, yaagira ati: Manya, omu kibuga kya Hamani habyairwemu ekiti kiraingwa kya mikono makumi ataano, eki Hamani ateekateekire kuhanikaho Morodekai, owaagambire ekigambo ky'okukiza omugabe. <verse eid="EST 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EST 7:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 7:16">Zab 7:16</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 11:5">Enf 11:5</ref>, <ref loc="PRO 11:6">6</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 26:27">26:27</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 6:24">Dan 6:24</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:2">Mat 7:2</ref>. </char></note> Omugabe nikwo kuragiira ati: Mube nikyo mwamuhanikaho. Batyo baahanika Hamani aha kiti eki yaabaire ateekateekyeire Morodekai. Okuruga aho ekiniga ky'omugabe kyaikaikana.<verse eid="EST 7:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EST 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="EST 8" />
  <para style="s1">Eby'okwikiriza Abayudaaya kwerwanaho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EST 8:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EST 2:7">Est 2:7</ref>, <ref loc="EST 2:15">15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eryo izooba omugabe Ahasuero yaaha omwigarire Esteeri enju ya Hamani omuzigu w'Abayudaaya. Kandi Morodekai yaija omu maisho g'omugabe, ahabw'okuba Esteeri akaba agambire oku ari nawe. <verse eid="EST 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EST 8:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 3:10">Est 3:10</ref>. </char></note> Omugabe yaajuura empeta y'akamanyiso ke ei ayakire Hamani, yaagiha Morodekai. Na Esteeri yaataho Morodekai kutegyeka enju ya Hamani.<verse eid="EST 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EST 8:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EST 9:24">Est 9:24</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima Esteeri yaagaruka yaagamba n'omugabe; yaamukwata amaguru, yaamweshengyereza naarira, ngu amareho enaama mbi ya Hamani Omuagagi, n'obwengye obu yaabaire acwire kucwekyereza Abayudaaya. <verse eid="EST 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EST 8:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 4:11">Est 4:11</ref>; <ref loc="EST 5:2">5:2</ref>. </char></note> Omugabe yaimukiza Esteeri enkoni ye y'ezaabu, <verse eid="EST 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EST 8:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 3:13">Est 3:13</ref>. </char></note> Esteeri yaimuka, yaayemerera omu maisho ge, yaagira ati: Omugabe ku araabe naakisiima akanshemerererwa, n'ebi ndaagambe bikamugwisa gye, kandi nkaba orikumushemeza, nimmweshengyereza, ku bahandiika ebaruha y'okuhindura busha ezi Hamani mwene Hamedasa Omuagagi yaahandiikire kucwekyereza Abayudaaya abari omu mashaza g'omugabe goona. <verse eid="EST 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EST 8:6" />Mbwenu nimbaasa nta kugumisiririza akabi akarihika aha ihanga ryaitu? Nari shi nimbaasa nta kugumisiririza okureeba beene waitu nibacwekyerezibwa? <verse eid="EST 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EST 8:7" />Omugabe Ahasuero yaagarukamu omwigarire Esteeri na Morodekai Omuyudaaya ati: Reeba, mpaire Esteeri enju ya Hamani, kandi Hamani bamuhanikire aha kiti nimmutura okubangira Abayudaaya omukono. <verse eid="EST 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EST 8:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 1:19">Est 1:19</ref>; <ref loc="EST 3:12">3:12</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo naimwe muhandiikire Abayudaaya, nk'oku murikwenda, omu iziina ry'omugabe, muteho akamanyiso k'empeta ye; ahabw'okuba ekiragiro ekihandiikirwe omu iziina ry'omugabe, kikahamibwa akamanyiso k'empeta ye, tihariho muntu orikubaasa kukiihaho. <verse eid="EST 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EST 8:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 1:1">Est 1:1</ref>, <ref loc="EST 1:22">22</ref>; <ref loc="EST 3:12">3:12</ref>. </char></note> Batyo omu bunaku obwo, aha kiro kya makumi abiri na bishatu omu kwezi kwa kashatu okurikwetwa Sivani, abahandiiki b'omugabe baayetwa, baahandiika ebi Morodekai aragiire aha by'Abayudaaya byona, baabitwekyera abategyeki b'omugabe, n'abandi bategyeki, n'abanyiginya b'omu mashaza goona, oku gari igana na makumi abiri na mushanju, okuruga Buhindi okuhika Esiopia, buri ishaza ryona nk'emihandiikire yaaryo oku yaabaire eri, na buri ihanga omu rurimi rwaryo; baabihandiikira n'Abayudaaya omu mihandiikire yaabo n'omu rurimi rwabo. <verse eid="EST 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EST 8:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 3:12">Est 3:12</ref>, <ref loc="EST 3:13">13</ref>. </char></note> Ebyo byona Morodekai yaabihandiika omu iziina ry'omugabe, yaabihamisa akamanyiso k'empeta y'omugabe, ebaruha yaazikwatsa baamatarisi, abaabaire bagyendera aha mbaraasi ezirikwiruka munonga, ezaabaire zizaaziibwe omu masyo g'omugabe, nizikora emirimo ye. <verse eid="EST 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EST 8:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 3:13">Est 3:13</ref>; <ref loc="EST 9:2">9:2</ref>, <ref loc="EST 9:10">10</ref>, <ref loc="EST 9:15">15</ref>, <ref loc="EST 9:16">16</ref>, <ref loc="EST 9:18">18</ref>. </char></note> Omuri ezo baruha omugabe yaikiriza Abayudaaya b'omu ndembo zoona, ngu bateeranire hamwe, beerwaneho bahamire, babone kwita n'okucwekyereza n'okumaraho engabo zoona z'eihanga ryona nari ez'eishaza ryona, eziribateera, baite n'abaana baabo abato n'abakazi baabo, kandi banyagye ebintu byabo; <verse eid="EST 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EST 8:12" />kandi ngu ebyo byona bikorerwe aha izooba rimwe, aha kiro kya ikumi na bishatu omu kwezi kwa ikumi n'abiri okurikwetwa Adari, omu mashaza goona ag'omugabe Ahasuero; <verse eid="EST 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EST 8:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 3:14">Est 3:14</ref>; <ref loc="EST 4:8">4:8</ref>. </char></note> kandi ngu ebihandiikirwe omuri ezo baruha bibugibwe nk'ekiragiro omuri buri ishaza, kandi birangwe omu mahanga goona, nibimanyisa Abayudaaya ku bashemereire kweteekateeka kwerwanaho ahari eryo izooba, nibahoora abazigu baabo.<verse eid="EST 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EST 8:14" />Batyo baamatarisi baatemba embaraasi ezirikwiruka munonga, ezaabaire zikora emirimo y'omugabe, baashohora nibeehuuta, nibagyemwa ekiragiro ky'omugabe. Kandi ekyo kiragiro kyabugibwa omu rurembo Shushani. <verse eid="EST 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EST 8:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 3:15">Est 3:15</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 41:42">Kut 41:42</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 5:29">Dan 5:29</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima Morodekai yaaruga omu maisho g'omugabe, yaashohora ajwaire bushuuti y'omugabe eya bururu kandi erikwera, ajwaire ekirunga kihango ky'ezaabu, kandi anagiire omunagiro gwa bafuta na bujwa; batyo ab'omu rurembo Shushani baateera akaari baashemererwa. <verse eid="EST 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EST 8:16" />N'Abayudaaya baajwerwa omushana, baatunga okushemererwa n'okwesiima n'ekitiinisa. <verse eid="EST 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EST 8:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 9:2">Est 9:2</ref>, <ref loc="EST 9:19">19</ref>, <ref loc="EST 9:22">22</ref>, <ref loc="EST 9:27">27</ref>. </char></note> Kandi omuri buri ishaza n'omu buri rurembo ahu ekiragiro ky'omugabe n'ekihandiiko kye byabaire bihika, Abayudaaya bakaba bashemererwa, beesiima, baagira obugyenyi n'ekiro kikuru ky'okuhuumuriraho. Baingi omu mahanga g'omuri egyo nsi baayehindura Abayudaaya, ahabw'okuba Abayudaaya bakabatiinisa.<verse eid="EST 8:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EST 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="EST 9" />
  <para style="s1">Abayudaaya okwita abazigu baabo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EST 9:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EST 3:13">Est 3:13</ref>; <ref loc="EST 8:12">8:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Aha kiro kya ikumi na bishatu ky'okwezi kwa ikumi n'abiri okurikwetwa Adari, ekiragiro ky'omugabe n'ekihandiiko kye bikaba nibyenda kuhikiirizibwa. Eryo izooba niryo abazigu b'Abayudaaya baabaire nibagira ngu nibaija kugira obushoboorozi aha Bayudaaya, kwonka kyahinduka, Abayudaaya baaba nibo baabugira aha bazigu baabo. <verse eid="EST 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EST 9:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 8:11">Est 8:11</ref>, <ref loc="EST 8:17">17</ref>. </char></note> Batyo Abayudaaya baateeranira omu ndembo zaabo z'omu mashaza g'omugabe Ahasuero goona, kukwata abaabaire nibenda kubakora kubi. Tihariho muntu n'omwe owaabaire naabaasa kubaza omu kaso, ahabw'okuba amahanga goona gakaba gabatiinire. <verse eid="EST 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EST 9:3" />Kandi abategyeki b'amashaza boona, n'abategyeki b'omugabe n'abandi bategyeki, n'abatware b'omu kikaari ky'omugabe, baaha Abayudaaya emikono, ahabw'okuba nabo bakaba batiinire Morodekai. <verse eid="EST 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EST 9:4" />Morodekai ogwo akaba ahindukire rugambwa omu ka y'omugabe, kandi okurangaanwa kwe kubugire omu mashaza goona; ahabw'okuba akaguma naayeyongyera kuhama. <verse eid="EST 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EST 9:5" />Batyo Abayudaaya baitsa abazigu baabo rurara, baabacwekyereza, baabamaraho; abaabaire nibabanga, baabagira nk'oku barikwenda. <verse eid="EST 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EST 9:6" />Omu rurembo rukuru Shushani Abayudaaya baitamu abashaija magana ataano, baabamaraho; <verse eid="EST 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EST 9:7" />kandi baita na Parishanidasa, Dalifooni, Asipaasa, <verse eid="EST 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EST 9:8" />Poraasa, Adalia, Aridasa, <verse eid="EST 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EST 9:9" />Parimashiita, Arisai, Aridai na Vaizaasa, <verse eid="EST 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EST 9:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 5:11">Est 5:11</ref>; <ref loc="EST 8:11">8:11</ref>. </char></note> boona ikumi beene Hamani mwene Hamedasa, omuzigu w'Abayudaaya; kwonka tibaagira ki baanyaga.<verse eid="EST 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EST 9:11" />Eryo izooba omubaro gw'abaitwa omu rurembo rukuru Shushani gwagambirwa omugabe. <verse eid="EST 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EST 9:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 5:6">Est 5:6</ref>; <ref loc="EST 7:2">7:2</ref>. </char></note> Omugabe yaagira omwigarire Esteeri ati: Abayudaaya baita abashaija magana ataano omu rurembo Shushani, baabamaraho; baita na beene Hamani ikumi. Mbwenu noogira ngu omu gandi mashaza g'omu bugabe bakozire ebirikwingana ki? Hariho ekindi eki orikushaba, okakiheebwa? Nari hariho ekindi eki orikwenda, ngu kihikiirizibwe? <verse eid="EST 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EST 9:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 8:11">Est 8:11</ref>. </char></note> Esteeri yaamugarukamu ati: Omugabe ku araabe naasiima, aikirize Abayudaaya abari omuri Shushani nyencakare batwaze nk'ekiragiro ky'eri izooba oku kyaba; kandi beene Hamani abo, oku bari ikumi, bahanikwe aha biti. <verse eid="EST 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EST 9:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 5:11">Est 5:11</ref>. </char></note> Atyo omugabe yaaragiira ku kiba kityo; ekiragiro kyabugibwa omuri Shushani, na beene Hamani oku bari ikumi baahanikwa. <verse eid="EST 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EST 9:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:15, 16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 8:11">Est 8:11</ref>. </char></note> Ku bwaseesire aha kiro kya ikumi na bina ky'okwezi Adari, Abayudaaya abaabaire bari omuri Shushani baateeranira hamwe, baita abashaija magana ashatu, kwonka nabwo tibaagira ki baanyaga.<verse eid="EST 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EST 9:16" />N'abandi Bayudaaya b'omu mashaza g'omugabe baateeranira hamwe, baayerwanaho, baita omu bazigu baabo abantu obukumi mushanju n'enkumi itaano, baahuumura ahabw'abazigu baabo, kandi nabwo tibaagira ki baanyaga. <verse eid="EST 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EST 9:17" />Okwo nikwo byabaire aha kiro kya ikumi na bishatu ky'okwezi Adari; aha kiro kya ikumi na bina baahuumura, baakigira ekiro kikuru ky'obugyenyi ky'okuriira hamwe n'okushemererwa. <verse eid="EST 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EST 9:18" />Kwonka Abayudaaya ab'omuri Shushani baateeranira hamwe aha kiro kya ikumi na bishatu n'ekya ikumi na bina eby'okwo kwezi; bwanyima aha kya ikumi na bitaano baahuumura, baakigira ekiro kikuru ky'obugyenyi ky'okuriira hamwe n'okushemererwa. <verse eid="EST 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EST 9:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 8:17">Est 8:17</ref>; <ref loc="REV 11:10">Kush 11:10</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 8:10">Neh 8:10</ref>, <ref loc="NEH 8:12">12</ref>. </char></note> Nikyo Abayudaaya ab'omu byaro, abatuura omuri tauni ezitaine ngo z'amabaare, baijukira ekiro kya ikumi na bina ky'okwezi Adari, bakakigira eizooba ry'okushemerererwaho n'okuriira hamwe, n'eizooba rirungi ry'okutwekyereraniraho eby'okurya.<verse eid="EST 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ebyo biro okuhinduka ebiro bikuru aha Bayudaaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EST 9:20" />Bwanyima Morodekai yaahandiika ebyo byona, kandi yaahandiika n'ebaruha, yaazitwekyera Abayudaaya boona, abaabaire bari omu mashaza g'omugabe Ahasuero goona, aba haihi n'aba hare, <verse eid="EST 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EST 9:21" />naabeehangiriza kwijuka ekiro kya ikumi na bina n'ekya ikumi na bitaano eby'okwezi Adari, kubigira ebiro bikuru buri mwaka; <verse eid="EST 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EST 9:22" />ahabw'okuba ahari ebyo biro nibwo Abayudaaya baahuumura abazigu baabo, kandi okwo kwezi nikwo kwababeereire okw'okushemererwa omu mwanya gw'obusaasi, kukaba okw'okuhuumuriramu omu mwanya gw'okuganya; kandi yaabaragiira ku babigira ebiro by'okuriira hamwe n'okushemererwa, n'eby'okutwekyereraniraho eby'okurya, n'okuha abooro ebiconco.<verse eid="EST 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EST 9:23" />Batyo Abayudaaya baaragaana ku bariguma nibabitwaza nk'oku baabitandika, kandi nk'oku Morodekai abahandiikiire. <verse eid="EST 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EST 9:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 3:6">Est 3:6</ref>, <ref loc="EST 3:7">7</ref>. </char></note> Ahabw'okuba Hamani mwene Hamedasa Omuagagi, omuzigu w'Abayudaaya boona, akaba abagiriire enaama y'okubacwekyereza, kandi akaba aragwize enteenyu ezirikwetwa Puuri, kubasingyeera n'okubamaraho; <verse eid="EST 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EST 9:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 7:9">Est 7:9</ref>, <ref loc="EST 7:10">10</ref>; <ref loc="EST 8:3">8:3</ref>, <ref loc="EST 8:7">7</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 7:16">Zab 7:16</ref>; <ref loc="OBA 1:15">Oba 15</ref>. </char></note> kwonka egyo naama ku yaahikire aha mugabe, omugabe yaaragiirira omu baruha ati: Egyo naama mbi y'okwita Abayudaaya ebe niwe yaagarukana, kandi ngu we n'abatabani bahanikwe aha biti. <verse eid="EST 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EST 9:26" />Nikyo ebyo biro babyetera Purimu, nibagyeterera Puuri. N'ahabw'ekyo ahabw'ebyahandiikirwe omuri egyo baruha, n'ebi Abayudaaya bareebire omuri ako kabi, kandi n'ebyabahikireho, <verse eid="EST 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EST 9:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 56:3">Isa 56:3</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 56:6">6</ref>. </char></note> bakaragiira, kandi baaragaana ahabwabo n'ahabwa baijukuru baabo, n'ahabwa boona abaakwataniise nabo, ku batarireka kwijuka ebyo biro bibiri, nk'ekihandiiko kyabyo oku kyabaire kiri, n'obunaku bwabyo obwataireho buri mwaka. <verse eid="EST 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EST 9:28" />Kandi baragiira ngu, omu miryango yoona, n'omuri buri ishaza, n'omuri buri rurembo bagume baijukye ebyo biro, babigire ebiro bikuru omu busingye bwona, kandi ngu ebyo biro bya Purimu, bitarihugwaho omu Bayudaaya, nari ekiijutsyo kyabyo okweba omu ruzaaro rwabo.<verse eid="EST 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EST 9:29" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:29: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EST 8:10">Est 8:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima omwigarire Esteeri, muhara wa Abihaili, na Morodekai Omuyudaaya, baahandiika n'obushoboorozi nibahamya egyo baruha ya kabiri eya Purimu. <verse eid="EST 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EST 9:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 1:1">Est 1:1</ref>; <ref loc="EST 8:9">8:9</ref>. </char></note> Ebaruha zaatwekyerwa Abayudaaya boona ab'omu mashaza igana na makumi abiri na mushanju ag'omu bugabe bwa Ahasuero, ezaabaire zirimu ebigambo by'obusingye n'amazima; <verse eid="EST 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EST 9:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 4:3">Est 4:3</ref>. </char></note> ngu zibone kuhamya ebyo biro bikuru bya Purimu omu bunaku obutairweho, nk'oku Morodekai Omuyudaaya n'omwigarire Esteeri baabiragiire Abayudaaya, bakabiragaana ahabwabo n'oruzaaro rwabo, eby'okwesiibyakwo n'amaganya gaabo. <verse eid="EST 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EST 9:32" />Kityo ekiragiro ky'omwigarire Esteeri kyahamya egyo migyenzo ya Purimu, kyahandiikwa n'omu kitabo.<verse eid="EST 9:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EST 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="EST 10" />
  <para style="s1">Eby'obukuru bwa Morodekai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EST 10:1" />Bwanyima omugabe Ahasuero yaacwera ensi n'ebirwa by'omu mayanja omushoro. <verse eid="EST 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EST 10:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 8:15">Est 8:15</ref>; <ref loc="EST 9:4">9:4</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu emirimo yoona ei yaakozire n'obushoboorozi bwe n'amaani ge, n'ebirikworeka ekitiinisa eki yaahaire Morodekai, akaba omuntu rugambwa, tibihandiikirwe omu kitabo ky'eby'omu busingye bw'abagabe ba Bumeedi na Buperisi? <verse eid="EST 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EST 10:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 41:40">Kut 41:40</ref>. </char></note> Ahabw'okuba ogwo Muyudaaya Morodekai niwe yaabaire ari owa kabiri aha mugabe Ahasuero; kandi akaba ari rugambwa omu Bayudaaya, naasiimwa beene waabo boona, ahabw'okuba akaba asherurira eihanga rye eby'okurikiza, kandi n'okwendeza abantu be obusingye.<verse eid="EST 10:3" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EST 10" />
</usx>